  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"2311\">\n<li data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1926\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1924\">Positive for one or more viruses:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1982\">\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1982\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Indicates active or recent viral gastroenteritis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2071\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Co-infections are possible, especially in outbreaks or immunocompromised patients.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2211\">\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2094\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2092\">All Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2211\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2131\">\n<p data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2131\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">No detectable viral pathogens.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2211\">\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2211\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Consider <strong data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2195\">bacterial, parasitic, or non-infectious causes</strong> for symptoms.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2311\">\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2311\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Clinical correlation is essential with <strong data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2308\">stool culture, parasite exams, and patient history</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
